WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
Hi, I'm Tilly! Meet the rail, your sidebar.

00:00:05.565 --> 00:00:07.965
The rail follows your pane into each folder.

00:00:08.556 --> 00:00:11.756
Control B, then e, moves the keyboard into the rail.

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:15.223
In the file list, a makes a new file.

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:17.648
The git section counts it right away.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:21.800
And d sends it to the trash, after asking first.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.620
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
